1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,400
The app, the database, and a straight line between them.

2
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:05,200
No token, no owner check, and a database on the internet.

3
00:00:05,600 --> 00:00:08,200
The firewall drops junk at the edge, before it costs you anything.

4
00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:11,200
It is the one public thing you own. Everything else hides behind it.

5
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:14,200
Your API checks the token signature. No token, no entry.

6
00:00:14,600 --> 00:00:17,200
Entra ID says she is Priya. Your API decides she gets Priya rows.

7
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:20,000
A private endpoint. You cannot attack what you cannot reach.

8
00:00:20,400 --> 00:00:22,800
Four checks in front, and no public address behind.
